lect is a labelled combobox that exposes its required state and its open state.","Each Evidence row is one native checkbox named by its render context and described by its freshness note; a warning description also carries an icon, so freshness is never conveyed by color alone.","The loading placeholder is a named status region; an error or conflict is announced as an alert.","Focus is a 2px primary outline on every control, and every control keeps a 44px target on touch tiers."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Panel, Select, Checkbox, ListItem, Skeleton, Alert, TextInput, Button); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","The open domain menu is the Select Widget's open state; the live Workbench keeps its own overlay.","Every visible string is bound with $i18n except identities and measurements (render contexts, variant names, digests, the View name); en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A human opened an open Review thread in the comment bubble or in the Reviews inbox and pressed \"Submit for review…\".","The dialog reads the anchored View's formal captures and the Run Checks records, Flow traces and interaction replays of the Workspace; the Workbench renders the live dialog and this View is its design reference.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the base state shows the dialog as it opens, with no change domain chosen and nothing ticked."],"intent":"Show the \"Submit for review\" dialog of the Workbench as built from Adapter Widgets only: a human moves an open Review thread to ready for review by choosing change domains and citing Evidence of the anchored View at its current revision.","interactionRules":["Change domains is a required multi-select over the known change domains; the note under it says whether the chosen domains affect the View's formal captures or leave them valid.","Formal captures list each capture as one row with its render context, whether it is current or why it is not, and its short digest; a stale or unknown capture is dimmed and cannot be ticked.","Run Checks records, Flow traces and interaction replays are listed in their own groups, always citable, each with when it ran or whether it is current.","Choosing the i18n, UX Flow or Interaction domain ticks, once, the latest Run Checks record, the current Flow traces or the passing current interaction replays; each can be unticked and none is required.","Submit stays disabled until a change domain and at least one piece of Evidence are chosen; a revision conflict keeps the choices and asks to submit again.","The optional note is free text for the reviewer."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the four core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"label":"Change domains preselect the Evidence that proves them (owner ruling 6)","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/241"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","variantName":"thread-open","viewId":"7f3d7780-3cb9-4e57-8f0b-2e8d569905c1"}],"requirements":["01a11544-5459-73a9-89d2-dd4d3ed42da3"]},"variants":{"citable-load-error":{"state":{"citable-error":{"visible":true}}},"dialog-domains-selected":{"requirements":["01a115cd-c715-7527-b773-cae2d87c8f33","01a11544-55d5-7ee4-9d63-327595144bdc"],"state":{"clear-wrap":{"visible":true},"domains":{"value":"IR, Variant"},"effect-affects":{"visible":true},"fc-1-check":{"checked":true},"fc-2-check":{"checked":true},"needs-hint":{"visible":false},"opt-ir":{"selected":true},"opt-variant":{"selected":true},"select-current":{"visible":false},"submit":{"disabled":false}}},"dialog-empty":{"state":{"list-formal":{"visible":false},"no-evidence":{"visible":true},"select-current-row":{"visible":false}}},"domain-select-